    "updated_at": "2021-08-15T13:35:19Z",
    "body": "Just in case somebody wants to see more example of toolbox custom support.\r\n```\r\n[custom.toolbox]\r\nwhen = \"test -e /run/.toolboxenv\"\r\ncommand = \"cat /run/.containerenv | grep name | awk -F '\\\"' '{print $2} '\"\r\nstyle = \"bold green\"\r\nsymbol = \"⬢\"\r\nformat = \"[$symbol toolbox]($style): $output\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
